  "title": "NotificationSchema",
  "outcome": "NOVA needs one notification record shape that both the fanout service and the preference center agree on. This workstream lands that shape: a Notification row per logical event, a NotificationDelivery row per subscriber, a category enum, and an idempotency key contract every producer must honour so a retried producer never doubles a user's inbox.",
